        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "BIONICLE: Matoran Adventures offers a fun character-switching feature to help players advance through each of the six levels found in the game. Players start as a Matoran and unlock more Matoran characters as they progress. Turaga, with their unique powers, can be \"picked up\" throughout the game to help the player through an elemental hazard like a lava pool or to activate a switch to a secret door. Once found, that \"picked-up\" Turaga follows you onwards in your adventure.",
